#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate a Darwin pyconfig.h for the Darling CPython cross-build.

CPython's configure script probes the host it runs on. Darling builds Mach-O
binaries on Linux, so those host results are not usable. This script starts
from CPython's pyconfig.h.in, leaves its structure intact, and defines the
Darwin feature set that the existing Python 2 framework already assumes.
"""

